---
description: FastAPI backend conventions for app/
globs: app/**/*.py, api/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Python backend

- Routes in `app/api/routes/`; schemas in `app/schemas/`; models in `app/models/`.
- Business logic in `app/services/`, not in route handlers.
- Settings from `app/core/config.py` — use env vars, never commit secrets.
- DB via SQLAlchemy in `app/core/db.py`; primary entity `Generation`.
- Match existing error handling and response shapes in neighboring routes.
